node_modules/
.env
service-account.json
client_secret*.json
client/dist/
package-lock.json

# Local-only artifacts (not committed).
# NOTE: git has no trailing-comment syntax in .gitignore — a `pattern  # note`
# line is matched verbatim, comment and all. These four entries carried trailing
# comments and therefore never actually matched anything; comments now sit on
# their own lines.

# favicons, hygiene batch reports, local-only assets
static/
# runtime watermarks + agenda cache (gmail history, agenda-cache.json, etc.)
state/
# Qdrant snapshot files (local rotation, last 3)
backups/
# in case a report lands at repo root by accident
brain-hygiene-batch-*.md
# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# The 2026-07-21 offline vault rebuild (scripts/rebuild-documents.mjs) writes a
# full People/Projects/Topics/customBrain/customBrainSummaries tree here. Kept
# on disk, deliberately NOT committed: the hourly export cron deletes and
# rewrites the entire customBrain/ folder on Drive from Qdrant, so those 409
# regenerated thoughts could never survive an hour there, and the summaries
# folder has no reader anywhere in the codebase. What IS committed is
# docs/rebuild/reports/ — the durable analysis — plus the script that can
# regenerate the tree from the read-only Drive source at any time.
docs/rebuild/People/
docs/rebuild/Projects/
docs/rebuild/Topics/
docs/rebuild/customBrain/
docs/rebuild/customBrainSummaries/
